; M4A1 table — Counter-Strike 1.6 reference values (UNSUPPRESSED default state).
; Scalars: https://csjs.live/weapons/m4a1 (32 dmg unsuppressed / 33 suppressed,
; 70% armor, 686 RPM / 0.0875 s cycle, 97% per 500 u (95% suppressed),
; 2 penetration stages, 30+90 ammo, 230 u/s).
; Code constants: https://github.com/s1lentq/ReGameDLL_CS
; - regamedll/dlls/weapons.h: M4A1_DAMAGE 32, M4A1_DAMAGE_SIL 33,
;   M4A1_RANGE_MODIFER 0.97, M4A1_RANGE_MODIFER_SIL 0.95,
;   M4A1_MAX_SPEED 230, M4A1_RELOAD_TIME 3.05, M4A1_ACCURACY_DIVISOR 220.
; - regamedll/dlls/wpn_shared/wpn_m4a1.cpp PrimaryAttack (both modes):
;   air 0.035+0.4*acc, move(>140u/s) 0.035+0.07*acc, grounded 0.02*acc
;   (0.025*acc suppressed; no duck branch); cycle 0.0875 s; FireBullets3
;   penetration 2, BULLET_PLAYER_556MM. First-shot spreads below use fresh
;   accuracy 0.2, atan(spread) to degrees: stand/duck 0.004 -> 0.2292,
;   move 0.049 -> 2.8052, air 0.115 -> 6.5602.
; - regamedll/dlls/weapontype.h: M4A1_MAX_CLIP 30, MAX_AMMO_556NATO 90.
; - regamedll/dlls/player.cpp TraceAttack: HITGROUP_HEAD damage x4;
;   TakeDamage: ARMOR_RATIO 0.5 x 1.4 (WEAPON_M4A1) = 0.70.
; - regamedll/dlls/cbase.cpp FireBullets3: falloff pow(rangeMod, dist/500);
;   wall damage x0.6 (CHAR_TEX_WOOD), penetration skip 35 u/stage
;   (BULLET_PLAYER_556MM).
; RecoilTable: authored for FrutaCS from the community-consensus M4 spray
; shape (tighter AK: climb 1-7, slight left 8-12, right 13-18, settle 19-30),
; cumulative pitch-up+/yaw-right+ degrees. COMMUNITY CONSENSUS.
; MaxWallThicknessU 48: consensus (below AK 64, above Deagle 32).
